SUMMARY:Linkup@bitcircus101
DESCRIPTION:Linkup@bitcircus101 is our signature monthly meetup for anyone 
 in Bonn’s tech scene to come together\, share ideas and unwind. Every th
 ird Friday of the month starting at 8 PM\, we kick things off with a serie
 s of lightning talks—short\, punchy presentations (3 slides in 3 minutes
  each) where people can showcase a project\, demo a tool or pose a new que
 stion. After the talks\, the formal program wraps up and we transition int
 o an open\, relaxed hangout: you can grab a drink or snack\, pull up a cha
 ir and dive into conversations with fellow tech-enthusiasts in a friendly\
 , low-pressure atmosphere.\n\nOn all the other Fridays\, we host Casual Li
 nkup at the same time—no talks\, just a laid-back environment to brainst
 orm\, get feedback\, troubleshoot problems or simply meet others who love 
 technology. Whether you’re here to present or to listen\, to ask questio
 ns or to offer advice\, Linkup is all about building real human connection
 s around shared tech interests
LOCATION:Dorotheenstraße 101\, 53111 Bonn
URL:https://bitcircus101.de
CATEGORIES:meetup,lightning-talks,talk
END:VEVENT
